{"id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-restricted-cnf-notation.md","title":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation — restricted cnf notation","display":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation — restricted cnf notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","display":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation — restricted cnf notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","[[73-df-standard-cnf]]"],"aliases":["73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","73-definition-4.5"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation — restricted cnf notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-restricted-cnf-notation</span><span>73-definition-4.5</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\">\\(G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(V\\cup T)^*\">\\(\\alpha\\in(V\\cup T)^*\\)</span>；单字符产生式使用显式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a\\rangle\">\\(\\langle a\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 保留原接口的全部三个分支，尤其保留终结产生式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\ne S\">\\(A\\ne S\\)</span> 条件；不将它替换成 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" href=\"?note=7fc5fa30c0841ef9\" title=\"73-df-standard-cnf\">73-df-standard-cnf</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CNF}\">\\(\\operatorname{CNF}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.5}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((A\\in V\\land\\alpha\\in V^2)\\lor(A\\in V\\land(\\exists a\\in T\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\\land A\\ne S)\\lor(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.5}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((A\\in V\\land\\alpha\\in V^2)\\lor(A\\in V\\land(\\exists a\\in T\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\\land A\\ne S)\\lor(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>该变体本身良定义，按要求原样保留。它与标准 CNF 不同；针对本接口的转换定理必须写出所需额外前提，不能从标准转换定理无条件套用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}$，见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]；$\\alpha\\in(V\\cup T)^*$；单字符产生式使用显式的 $\\langle a\\rangle$。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-standard-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"7fc5fa30c0841ef9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CNF}$ 保留原接口的全部三个分支，尤其保留终结产生式的 $A\\ne S$ 条件；不将它替换成 [[73-df-standard-cnf]] 的 $\\operatorname{CNF}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,T,P,S)\\in\\mathrm{CFG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(V\\cup T)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\ne S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}4.5}\\vdash\nG\\in\\mathrm{CNF}\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall(A,\\alpha)\\in P\\;\n\\bigl((A\\in V\\land\\alpha\\in V^2)\\lor(A\\in V\\land(\\exists a\\in T\\;\\alpha=\\langle a\\rangle)\\land A\\ne S)\\lor(A=S\\land\\alpha=\\varepsilon)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1193,"backlinks":[{"id":"248908af8dc82492","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CFG},L(G)$、旧版 $\\mathrm{CNF}$ 分别见 [[73-df-cfg-notation]]、[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]、[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]；终结字母表固定为 $\\Sigma$。"}],"outgoing":["c0217e1a08a868eb","7fc5fa30c0841ef9"]}